Building ucsd-psystem-fs
========================

These tools are built by the top-level Makefile of the UCSD-P-System
repository; see README.md there.

Requirements:

    C++17 compiler   The code is compiled as standard C++17.
    FUSE 2           Optional.  Needed only for ucsdpsys_mount and
                     ucsdpsys_umount; build with FUSE=no to skip them.

libexplain is not needed: a small stand-in is bundled in
subprojects/libexplain.

Peter Miller's original build instructions (Boost, autoconf) are kept, for
history, in etc/BUILDING.man.
